  "rationale": "Temporary security build for GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm (CVE-2026-93687: stack exhaustion in the recursive AST walkers through deeply nested patterns), which affects every published braces release with no fixed version. braces is reached only by the Electron Forge build toolchain (fast-glob/micromatch), not by the packaged app. The 3.0.3 code is used unchanged except for a parse-time nesting limit.",
  "removalCriteria": "Remove after upstream publishes a braces release that fixes GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm and the advisory lists it as patched, with npm audit remaining at zero. If the advisory range becomes < 3.0.4, npm audit (which compares prereleases) reports 3.0.4-nexus.1 on purpose, forcing the switch.",
